{%- comment -%}
  UMS cart note — pickup-only messaging for the cart page and the cart drawer.

  Replaces Dawn's "Taxes, discounts and shipping calculated at checkout" line
  (brief §7). The store never ships, so no shipping language may appear in the
  cart. Also carries the all-sales-final callout the brief wants visible before
  checkout (§4), and the store hours.

  Copy is edited in Theme settings → UMS cart note, never here.

  Usage:
    render 'ums-cart-note'                  cart page (sections/main-cart-footer)
    render 'ums-cart-note', compact: true   cart drawer (snippets/cart-drawer)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign note_title = settings.ums_cart_note_title
  assign note_body = settings.ums_cart_note_body
  assign note_tax = settings.ums_cart_tax_note
-%}

{%- if note_title != blank or note_body != blank or note_tax != blank -%}
  <div class="ums-cart-note{% if compact %} ums-cart-note--compact{% endif %}">
    {%- if note_title != blank -%}
      <p class="ums-cart-note__title">{{ note_title | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if note_body != blank -%}
      <div class="ums-cart-note__body">{{ note_body }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if note_tax != blank -%}
      <p class="ums-cart-note__tax">{{ note_tax | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
